      "id": 5151,
      "name": "Christopher",
      "username": "Christopher",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-30T15:34:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Upon returning from PAX, I thought I’d check to see if there was much about Sentinels on the youtube…</p>\n<p>There is.  So I’m compiling them here!  Enjoy!</p>\n<p>The Drive-Thru Review: <a href=\"http://youtu.be/BoUwiJCqTUE\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://youtu.be/BoUwiJCqTUE</a></p>\n<p>Andy Arenson does an overview: <a href=\"http://youtu.be/YtM4idwHEK4\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://youtu.be/YtM4idwHEK4</a></p>\n<p>The guys from The Spiel interview Christopher and Adam at Gen Con 2011: <a href=\"http://youtu.be/8BdC-sAUUOM\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://youtu.be/8BdC-sAUUOM</a></p>\n<p>Tom Vasel does his Dice Tower review: <a href=\"http://youtu.be/eO6CTK3nV38\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://youtu.be/eO6CTK3nV38</a></p>\n<p>Drakkenstrike’s amazing comic-book style animated video: <a href=\"http://youtu.be/KM3FFk9jNvY\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://youtu.be/KM3FFk9jNvY</a></p>\n<p>The Down The Road show interviewed Christopher at the Chicago Comic Con: <a href=\"http://youtu.be/e-A2fsyS6pE\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://youtu.be/e-A2fsyS6pE</a></p>\n<p>Know of any I missed?  Post them here!</p>",
