      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Upon returning from PAX, I thought I'd check to see if there was much about Sentinels on the youtube...\n\nThere is.  So I'm compiling them here!  Enjoy!\n\n\nThe Drive-Thru Review: [url=http://youtu.be/BoUwiJCqTUE]http://youtu.be/BoUwiJCqTUE[/url]\n\nAndy Arenson does an overview: [url=http://youtu.be/YtM4idwHEK4]http://youtu.be/YtM4idwHEK4[/url]\n\nThe guys from The Spiel interview Christopher and Adam at Gen Con 2011: [url=http://youtu.be/8BdC-sAUUOM]http://youtu.be/8BdC-sAUUOM[/url]\n\nTom Vasel does his Dice Tower review: [url=http://youtu.be/eO6CTK3nV38]http://youtu.be/eO6CTK3nV38[/url]\n\nDrakkenstrike's amazing comic-book style animated video: [url=http://youtu.be/KM3FFk9jNvY]http://youtu.be/KM3FFk9jNvY[/url]\n\nThe Down The Road show interviewed Christopher at the Chicago Comic Con: [url=http://youtu.be/e-A2fsyS6pE]http://youtu.be/e-A2fsyS6pE[/url]\n\n\nKnow of any I missed?  Post them here!",
