      "created_at": "2011-10-06T22:03:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I apologize if you have seen this video review, but it bears repeating. This guy gives you some of the greatest compliments any game designer / storyteller could ever receive.</p>\n<div class=\"youtube-onebox lazy-video-container\" data-video-id=\"FcTIjqsKvy4\" data-video-title=\"Sentinels of the Multiverse Review\" data-video-start-time=\"\" data-provider-name=\"youtube\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FcTIjqsKvy4\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"video-thumbnail\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n    <img class=\"youtube-thumbnail\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5aadf5e14d37a7bc60834972e976d5fcf26f9633.jpeg\" title=\"Sentinels of the Multiverse Review\" data-dominant-color=\"82726D\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<p>Well done. My copy arrives tomorrow. I cannot wait to have it my hands.</p>\n<p>Thanks again for bringing this great game to the market.</p>",
