      "created_at": "2011-10-22T13:48:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Have you checked out our Facebook page?</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/yz/r/KFyVIAWzntM.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sentinelsotm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">facebook.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/86b4e1d4bf88542fe4f8aaca01fffc14f67e3e5d.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sentinelsotm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sentinels of the Multiverse</a></h3>\n\n<p>Sentinels of the Multiverse. 7,216 likes · 2 talking about this. Sentinels of the Multiverse is a comic-book flavored cooperative card game!</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>We have pictures of someone WHO YOU’VE ALL TALKED TO as Legacy, as well as some people from Gen Con as Tachyon, The Wraith, Tempest, and even Citizen Dawn!</p>",
